				<text><![CDATA[We, the undersigned members of the Inspectorate Team, conducted a final inspection on the above stated project, and found the same to be free from failures and defects which are traceable to poor workmanship, use of poor quality materials and non-compliance with Plans and Specification of the Contract.]]></text>
